{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.meguru.purity.question",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "纯白 · 恋爱是什么",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.meguru.purity.question",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.meguru.purity.question",
    "idolId": "meguru",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "她说，之前舞蹈课请来的老师讲过——就算很认真地跳，也不足以表现自己的感情。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "要我回忆起恋爱时的心动，然后更加投入……",
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "可是，我……根本不知道这种东西啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "n04"
      },
      "n04": {
        "id": "n04",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "制作人知道吗？恋爱是什么感觉？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "心动的感觉",
            "nextNodeId": "n05a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "心头一紧的感觉",
            "nextNodeId": "n05b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "你可以看看书",
            "nextNodeId": "n05c",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n05a": {
        "id": "n05a",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "心跳会变快那种？……唔，好像有点明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05b": {
        "id": "n05b",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "心头一紧……听起来好难啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05c": {
        "id": "n05c",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "书！对哦，书里应该写着！",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "text": "你反问她，自己没有心动的时候吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "有啊。站在舞台上的时候！",
        "nextNodeId": "n08"
      },
      "n08": {
        "id": "n08",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "在后台的时候，真乃和灯织在旁边，等待出场的时候最激动了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "n09"
      },
      "n09": {
        "id": "n09",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "那样就好？就算不是恋爱？",
        "nextNodeId": "n10"
      },
      "n10": {
        "id": "n10",
        "text": "你说老师想说的，大概就是像恋爱那样强烈的心意吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "n11"
      },
      "n11": {
        "id": "n11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "是吗……！如果不马上恋爱就不行的话，我还在想要怎么办呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "n12"
      },
      "n12": {
        "id": "n12",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "好，我现在就来试试看……！嘿……恋爱是好事啊……"
      }
    }
  },
